{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Throw A Life!</strong> is a party survival game for up to four players! Team up with friends to mine, craft, build, and hunt as you work together to survive on a harsh island. Strategize by dividing roles or embrace the chaos and have fun! Show off your teamwork and take on the adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Survive as long as you can!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Teamwork is essential to endure the harsh survival challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Divide tasks like mining, crafting, building, and hunting wisely to make it through!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2026But beware of hunger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443790/extras/SurvivalPerty_Screenshot_05.gif?t=1744152564\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Prepare for enemy surprise attack!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hurry... The enemy attacks at night!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft weapons and build your base before night falls to prepare for the enemy's surprise attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443790/extras/SurvivalPerty_Screenshot_06.gif?t=1744152564\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Defeat bosses and earn rewards!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive tough boss battles or defeat bosses to earn rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Show your teamwork and use a variety of weapons to fight the boss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443790/extras/SurvivalPerty_Screenshot_04.gif?t=1744152564\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 10 unique items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Local cooperative multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chaotic boss battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High difficulty survival</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3443790?t=1744152564","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3443790?t=1744152564","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443790/9b47fdb1a31946c5473b289358ba813c1ef30192/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744152564","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443790/9b47fdb1a31946c5473b289358ba813c1ef30192/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744152564","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Throw A Life!</strong> is a party survival game for up to four players! Team up with friends to mine, craft, build, and hunt as you work together to survive on a harsh island. Strategize by dividing roles or embrace the chaos and have fun! Show off your teamwork and take on the adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Survive as long as you can!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Teamwork is essential to endure the harsh survival challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Divide tasks like mining, crafting, building, and hunting wisely to make it through!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2026But beware of hunger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443790/extras/SurvivalPer